WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.063 --> 00:00:04.383
"Cool!" Jack said. "A real knight!"

2
00:00:04.384 --> 00:00:09.461
Mara laughed. "That's not a real knight, Jack.

3
00:00:09.462 --> 00:00:13.278
It's just a person dressed up like a knight."

4
00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:16.707
Roxy and her friends were at the Metro City Kingdom Festival.

5
00:00:16.708 --> 00:00:18.763
Lots of people wore costumes.

6
00:00:18.764 --> 00:00:22.001
They looked like people from a long time ago.

7
00:00:22.002 --> 00:00:26.209
A man sang and played a harp. A jester juggled.

8
00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:31.327
"Let's go," Terrell said. "The jousting event is starting soon."

9
00:00:31.328 --> 00:00:33.357
They found seats in the front row.

10
00:00:33.358 --> 00:00:35.906
Soon other people sat down.

11
00:00:35.907 --> 00:00:39.380
A fancy throne sat on a big stage.

12
00:00:39.381 --> 00:00:42.801
"This is exciting!" Roxy said.

13
00:00:42.802 --> 00:00:49.145
A horn blared. A man stepped onto the stage.

14
00:00:49.146 --> 00:00:51.990
"Ladies and gentlemen!" he said.

15
00:00:51.991 --> 00:00:54.650
"The queen has arrived!"

16
00:00:54.651 --> 00:00:57.819
A woman dressed as a queen walked onstage.

17
00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:03.273
She waved to the crowd and then sat on the throne.

18
00:01:03.274 --> 00:01:05.357
The man held up a scroll.

19
00:01:05.358 --> 00:01:11.538
"By order of Her Majesty, the queen, let the jousting begin!"

20
00:01:11.539 --> 00:01:13.672
*** Soon it was Sir Dillard's

21
00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:16.268
turn. "Finally!" he

22
00:01:16.269 --> 00:01:21.103
thought. He rode his horse onto the

23
00:01:21.104 --> 00:01:24.936
field. The crowd

24
00:01:24.937 --> 00:01:28.901
cheered. In front of the stage, he bowed his head to the

25
00:01:28.902 --> 00:01:33.779
queen. Then he rode to one end of the field, waving at

26
00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:37.932
everyone. A man handed him a lance and a

27
00:01:37.933 --> 00:01:42.554
shield. Sir Dillard raised his shield high. "For the queen!"

28
00:01:42.555 --> 00:01:44.853
The crowd cheered again.

29
00:01:44.854 --> 00:01:47.581
A knight appeared at the other end of the field.

30
00:01:47.582 --> 00:01:54.153
After a horn blared, Sir Dillard raced toward him.

31
00:01:54.154 --> 00:01:57.083
Clash! His lance hit the other knight.

32
00:01:57.084 --> 00:02:00.499
But the knight stayed on his horse!

33
00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:04.033
Sir Dillard turned around and charged back toward the other knight.

34
00:02:04.034 --> 00:02:05.782
Suddenly he heard a beep.

35
00:02:05.783 --> 00:02:08.678
He dropped his lance and stopped his horse.

36
00:02:08.679 --> 00:02:12.940
Then he ripped off his helmet. "What was that?" he yelled at the crowd.

37
00:02:12.941 --> 00:02:15.033
Everyone looked confused.

38
00:02:15.034 --> 00:02:17.950
Sir Dillard drew his sword.

39
00:02:17.951 --> 00:02:20.567
"Someone has a modern device!

40
00:02:20.568 --> 00:02:23.210
And it interrupted the queen's jousting event!

41
00:02:23.211 --> 00:02:26.903
I demand to know whose device made the noise!"

42
00:02:26.904 --> 00:02:30.252
A man raised his hand. "Um, it was me.

43
00:02:30.253 --> 00:02:33.086
But it's not really a big deal . . ."

44
00:02:33.087 --> 00:02:37.155
"How can you say such a thing?" Sir Dillard snapped.

45
00:02:37.156 --> 00:02:40.577
The man shrugged. "Sorry, but I got an important text.

46
00:02:40.578 --> 00:02:43.749
I'm helping to plan Metro City's new technology hub.

47
00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:46.545
Lots of technology companies will be moving in.

48
00:02:46.546 --> 00:02:49.298
We're having an opening ceremony next month."

49
00:02:49.299 --> 00:02:52.476
People in the crowd began to talk.

50
00:02:52.477 --> 00:02:54.342
"That sounds great."

51
00:02:54.343 --> 00:02:56.727
"Maybe I'll get a job there!"

52
00:02:56.728 --> 00:02:58.751
Sir Dillard grew furious.

53
00:02:58.752 --> 00:03:01.358
"A technology hub?" he thought.

54
00:03:01.359 --> 00:03:04.281
"In Metro City?" He made a fist.

55
00:03:04.282 --> 00:03:08.946
"I won't let that happen!"

